description:
Minimizes transitions in sidebar by setting

```css
.bslib-sidebar-layout {
  --bslib-sidebar-transition-duration: 5ms;
};
```

It turns out we need _a little_ transition time or the final part of the sidebar state transition lifecycle doesn't happen.

